                      "parameters":  {
                                         "content":  "## ?? Daily Parcel Notifications\n\n**Trigger:** Runs every morning at 8:00 AM\n\n**What it does:**\n1. Queries `v_allocation_details_with_availability` for panelists with parcels where `status = pending` and `fecha_programada = TODAY`\n2. Returns one row per distinct panelist (telegram_id + language)\n3. Calls **Parcels to send** workflow once per panelist\n\n**Parcels to send** workflow handles:\n- Fetches full parcel details for the panelist\n- Sends Telegram message with parcel list\n- Updates status ? `notified`\n- Saves conversation memory",
                                         "height":  320,
                                         "width":  380,
                                         "color":  3
                                     }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "sticky-reminder",
                      "name":  "Sticky Note - Reminder",
                      "type":  "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
                      "typeVersion":  1,
                      "position":  [
                                       -280,
                                       336
                                   ],
                      "parameters":  {
                                         "content":  "## ?? Daily Reminder for Overdue Parcels\n\n**Trigger:** Runs every morning at 8:00 AM\n\n**What it does:**\n1. Queries panelists with parcels where `status = notified` and `fecha_programada \u003c TODAY`\n2. These are parcels that were notified but NOT yet sent by the panelist\n3. Calls **Parcels to send** workflow once per panelist as a reminder\n\n**Note:** Same workflow handles both first notifications and reminders.",
                                         "height":  260,
                                         "width":  380,
                                         "color":  5
                                     }
                  },
                  {
                      "id":  "sticky-exec",
                      "name":  "Sticky Note - Execute",
